' 기능 흐름 지도
' 목적: 기능 변경 시 어떤 Controller, Service, Repository, Entity, Event, Client가 함께 영향을 받는지 빠르게 파악한다.

@startuml write_review_and_recommendation_request
title 01. 감상문 작성 + 추천 요청 시작

actor "Frontend\nWriteReviewPage" as FE
participant "UserReviewController" as Controller
participant "UserReviewService" as Service
database "UserReviewRepository" as UserReviewRepo
collections "ApplicationEventPublisher" as EventPublisher
queue "RecommendationRequestEvent" as Event
participant "Transaction Manager" as Tx
participant "RecommendationEventListener\n@Async + AFTER_COMMIT" as Listener
participant "AiRecommendationClient" as Client
participant "FastAPI\n/recommend/review" as FastAPI

FE -> Controller: POST /api/user-reviews\nUserReviewRequest
Controller -> Service: createUserReview(request)
activate Service
Service -> UserReviewRepo: save(UserReview)
UserReviewRepo --> Service: saved UserReview(id, PENDING)
Service -> EventPublisher: publishEvent(RecommendationRequestEvent)
EventPublisher -> Event: reviewId, reviewContent, userId
Service --> Controller: UserReviewCreateResponse(id)
deactivate Service
Controller --> FE: 201 ApiResponse(data.id)

Tx -> Listener: after commit event delivery
activate Listener
Listener -> Client: requestRecommendation(reviewId, reviewContent, userId)
activate Client
Client -> FastAPI: POST /recommend/review\nreview_id, review_content, user_id
FastAPI --> Client: 2xx accepted
deactivate Client
deactivate Listener

note right of Service
영향 범위 예시:
- 저장 필드 추가: UserReviewRequest, UserReview, UserReviewService, 테스트
- FastAPI 요청 필드 추가: RecommendationRequestEvent, RecommendationEventListener, AiRecommendationClient, FastAPI 계약
- 비동기/트랜잭션 정책 변경: UserReviewService, RecommendationEventListener, AsyncConfig
end note
@enduml

@startuml recommendation_callback
title 02. FastAPI 추천 결과 콜백 저장

participant "FastAPI" as FastAPI
participant "RecommendAlbumController" as Controller
participant "RecommendAlbumService" as Service
database "UserReviewRepository" as UserReviewRepo
entity "UserReview" as UserReview
database "RecommendAlbumRepository" as RecommendRepo

FastAPI -> Controller: POST /api/user-reviews/{reviewId}/recommendations\nRecommendAlbumCallbackRequest
Controller -> Service: createRecommendAlbums(reviewId, request)
activate Service
Service -> UserReviewRepo: findById(reviewId)
UserReviewRepo --> Service: UserReview

alt request.status == FAILED
    Service -> UserReview: failRecommendation()
    Service --> Controller: void
else request.status == COMPLETED
    Service -> Service: map request.recommendations\nto RecommendAlbum list
    Service -> RecommendRepo: saveAll(albums)
    Service -> UserReview: completeRecommendation()
    Service --> Controller: void
else unsupported status or null
    Service --> Controller: IllegalArgumentException
end

deactivate Service
Controller --> FastAPI: 2xx if handled

note right of Service
영향 범위 예시:
- 콜백 payload 변경: RecommendAlbumCallbackRequest, RecommendAlbumService, 테스트, API_SPEC
- 추천 저장 필드 추가: RecommendAlbum, RecommendAlbumRepository, RecommendAlbumResponse, DB migration
- 상태 전이 정책 변경: UserReview, RecommendAlbumService, UserReviewResponse
end note
@enduml

@startuml polling_recommendation_result
title 03. 추천 결과 Polling 조회

actor "Frontend\nReviewBasedRecommendPage" as FE
participant "UserReviewController" as Controller
participant "UserReviewService" as Service
database "UserReviewRepository" as UserReviewRepo
database "RecommendAlbumRepository" as RecommendRepo
participant "UserReviewResponse" as ResponseDto

loop polling until COMPLETED or FAILED
    FE -> Controller: GET /api/user-reviews/{id}
    Controller -> Service: getUserReview(id)
    activate Service
    Service -> UserReviewRepo: findById(id)
    UserReviewRepo --> Service: UserReview(recommendationStatus)

    alt status == COMPLETED
        Service -> RecommendRepo: findByUserReviewId(id)
        RecommendRepo --> Service: List<RecommendAlbum>
        Service -> ResponseDto: from(review, recommendations)
    else status == PENDING
        Service -> ResponseDto: from(review, empty list)
    else status == FAILED
        Service -> ResponseDto: from(review, empty list)
    end

    Service --> Controller: UserReviewResponse
    deactivate Service
    Controller --> FE: 200 UserReviewResponse
end

note right of Service
GET 조회는 read-only 동작이다.
PENDING/FAILED 조회에서 이벤트를 재발행하지 않는다.

영향 범위 예시:
- 화면 표시 필드 추가: UserReviewResponse, RecommendAlbumResponse, Service 분기, 프론트 DTO
- polling 정책 변경: UserReviewController, UserReviewService, 프론트 polling 로직
end note
@enduml

@startuml retry_recommendation
title 04. 추천 재시도

actor "Frontend\nReviewBasedRecommendPage" as FE
participant "UserReviewController" as Controller
participant "UserReviewService" as Service
database "UserReviewRepository" as UserReviewRepo
entity "UserReview" as UserReview
collections "ApplicationEventPublisher" as EventPublisher
queue "RecommendationRequestEvent" as Event
participant "Transaction Manager" as Tx
participant "RecommendationEventListener\n@Async + AFTER_COMMIT" as Listener
participant "AiRecommendationClient" as Client
participant "FastAPI" as FastAPI

FE -> Controller: POST /api/user-reviews/{id}/retry
Controller -> Service: retryRecommendation(id)
activate Service
Service -> UserReviewRepo: findById(id)
UserReviewRepo --> Service: UserReview
Service -> UserReview: retryRecommendation()\nstatus = PENDING
Service -> EventPublisher: publishEvent(RecommendationRequestEvent)
EventPublisher -> Event: reviewId, reviewContent, userId
Service --> Controller: void
deactivate Service
Controller --> FE: 200 ApiResponse<Void>

Tx -> Listener: after commit event delivery
Listener -> Client: requestRecommendation(reviewId, reviewContent, userId)
Client -> FastAPI: POST /recommend/review

note right of Service
영향 범위 예시:
- retry 허용 조건 변경: UserReview.retryRecommendation(), UserReviewService, 테스트
- retry 응답 형식 변경: UserReviewController, ApiResponse, API_SPEC, 프론트 처리
end note
@enduml

@startuml public_user_reviews
title 05. 공개 감상문 목록 조회

actor "Frontend\nReview List Page" as FE
participant "UserReviewController" as Controller
participant "UserReviewService" as Service
database "UserReviewRepository" as UserReviewRepo
participant "UserReviewSummaryResponse" as SummaryDto

FE -> Controller: GET /api/user-reviews?page=&size=
Controller -> Service: getPublicUserReviews(page, size)
activate Service
Service -> UserReviewRepo: findByIsPublicTrueOrderByCreatedAtDesc(PageRequest)
UserReviewRepo --> Service: Page<UserReview>
Service -> SummaryDto: from(UserReview)
Service --> Controller: Page<UserReviewSummaryResponse>
deactivate Service
Controller --> FE: 200 Page<UserReviewSummaryResponse>

note right of Service
영향 범위 예시:
- 목록 필드 추가: UserReviewSummaryResponse, UserReviewService, 프론트 카드
- 공개 범위/정렬 변경: UserReviewRepository query, Service, 테스트
end note
@enduml

@startuml critics_reviews
title 06. 전문가 리뷰 목록/상세 조회

actor "Frontend\nCriticsReviewPage" as FE
participant "CriticsReviewController" as Controller
participant "CriticsReviewService" as Service
database "CriticsReviewRepository" as CriticsRepo
participant "CriticsReviewSummaryResponse" as SummaryDto
participant "CriticsReviewResponse" as DetailDto

alt 목록 조회
    FE -> Controller: GET /api/critics?page=&size=
    Controller -> Service: getReviews(page, size)
    activate Service
    Service -> CriticsRepo: findByReviewSummaryIsNotNull(PageRequest)
    CriticsRepo --> Service: Page<CriticsReview>
    Service --> Controller: Page<CriticsReview>
    deactivate Service
    Controller -> SummaryDto: from(CriticsReview)
    Controller --> FE: 200 Page<CriticsReviewSummaryResponse>
else 상세 조회
    FE -> Controller: GET /api/critics/{id}
    Controller -> Service: getReview(id)
    activate Service
    Service -> CriticsRepo: findById(id)
    CriticsRepo --> Service: CriticsReview or empty
    alt exists
        Service --> Controller: CriticsReview
        Controller -> DetailDto: from(CriticsReview)
        Controller --> FE: 200 CriticsReviewResponse
    else missing
        Service --> Controller: ResourceNotFoundException
        Controller --> FE: 404 ErrorResponse
    end
    deactivate Service
end

note right of Service
영향 범위 예시:
- 전문가 리뷰 필드 추가: CriticsReview, Summary/Detail DTO, Controller mapping
- 목록 필터 변경: CriticsReviewRepository, CriticsReviewService, 테스트
end note
@enduml
